# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: gantt-no-undef >> invalid >>> docs/rules/gantt-no-undef.md incorrect 1
Filename: gantt-no-undef-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | gantt
  2 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  3 |   Design :des1, 2024-01-06, 3d
  4 |   click des2 href "https://example.com"
    |         ^~~~ [1]
  5 |

[1] mermaid.js binds nothing to `des2` in this `click` statement: no task has this id.
---


Test: gantt-no-undef >> invalid >>> docs/rules/gantt-no-undef.md incorrect 2
Filename: gantt-no-undef-incorrect-2.mmd

Code:
  1 | gantt
  2 |   dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  3 |   Design :des1, 2024-01-06, 3d
  4 |   Build :after des2, 5d
    |          ^~~~~~~~~~ [1]
